                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4992/12.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Fletcher to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-10-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 5,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Fletcher states that McKinley has been arrested at Mukden by the Chinese
                    authorities.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
